  "question": {
    "text": "A circle touching the <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math> axis at <math><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and making an intercept of length <math><mn>8</mn></math> on the <math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo></math> axis passes through the point:",
